  "title": "Venture Global Announces Closing of $1.5 Billion Senior Secured Vessel Financing Facility",
  "summary": "Arlington, Va. — Venture Global, Inc. (NYSE: VG) announced today that its wholly-owned subsidiary, Venture Global Shipping Holdings, LLC (“VGSH”), has entered into a Credit and Guaranty Agreement providing for a senior secured term loan facility (the “Facility”) in an aggregate principal amount of up to $1,500,000,000. The Facility will mature on June 26, 2032.",
